# Docs that scripts/wiki-sync.sh must not publish to the public GitHub wiki.
# One file name per line. A name here that no longer exists in docs/ fails the sync, so a rename
# cannot quietly re-expose a file.
#
# The wiki is public. Anything naming a live deployment, an incident, or a decision still being
# argued belongs in the repository, where the reader already has the context.

# Names a real exposure on a live deployment.
marketplace-and-contribution-plan.md

# Hardcoded proof-of-concept detail and deployment specifics.
access-control.md
device-trust.md

# A parked design argument, not documentation.
workflow-engine-rethink.md

